Im currently using the 1.20.1 version, but this is still a thing on master.
You check if a slot is a player slot using `selectedSlot.container == mc.player.getInventory();` in `findPullSlot()` and `findPushSlot()`. 
However in my UI lib https://github.com/brachy84/ModularUI-Modern slots are always a SlotItemHandler and the container field is an empty placeholder container. The check should instead look something like this
```java
public boolean isPlayerSlot(Slot slot) {
    if (slot instanceof SlotItemHandler slotItemHandler) {
        return slotItemHandler.getItemHandler() instanceof PlayerInvWrapper || 
                slotItemHandler.getItemHandler() instanceof PlayerMainInvWrapper;
    }
    return slot.container instanceof Inventory;
}
```
